# TagAlng (this repo)

Building **backend** for TagAlng: block-scoped social product for **all adults** (Identity × Vicinity × Activity). Mom/Lake Nona = launch wedge only.

**Before coding:** read `.cursor/skills/tagalng-backend/SKILL.md` and follow its checklist. Canonical PDFs are in repo root (`Tagalong-CTO-Spec.pdf`, `TagAlng-RD-Kickoff.pdf`, `tagalong-agentic-spec.pdf`).

**Hard rules:** Supabase Postgres is source of truth; RLS enforces privacy; never generate events; never store race/exact age/sex/street; OTP deferred until RSVP/host/refine; AI via Cloud Run + Vertex only.

**Speed:** smallest vertical slice — migration + RLS + one API per PR.
